{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_8F1C43B3","title":"Agent Teleshko asks you to snitch","entry":"Dlg_8F1C43B3::entry","exit":"Dlg_8F1C43B3::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_1AAB2614","articyId":"72057645577538511","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Agent Teleshko","text":"Good day citizen.","speakerId":"Ntt_2B1C9A1E","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Good day citizen.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":0.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"44216","byteOffset":31061624,"byteLength":328}},{"id":"DFr_D5148984","articyId":"72057645577538524","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Agent Teleshko","text":"I need some information. I'm going to ask you some questions. You'll answer truthfully. Is that clear?","speakerId":"Ntt_2B1C9A1E","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I need some information. I'm going to ask you some questions. You'll answer truthfully. Is that clear?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":600.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"23708","byteOffset":16850472,"byteLength":484}},{"id":"DFr_C7DD0CD3","articyId":"72057645577538563","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Agent Teleshko","text":"You better watch yourself citizen. I'm going to ask you some questions, and what you say will have a big effect on your future. For example, whether you have one.","speakerId":"Ntt_2B1C9A1E","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You better watch yourself citizen. I'm going to ask you some questions, and what you say will have a big effect on your future. For example, whether you have one.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":1500.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"42230","byteOffset":30305032,"byteLength":472}},{"id":"DFr_A4CD308E","articyId":"72057645577538568","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Agent Teleshko","text":"There are three citizens I need to ask you about. Suffice it to say, I have plenty of reason to question this trios' motives.","speakerId":"Ntt_2B1C9A1E","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"There are three citizens I need to ask you about. Suffice it to say, I have plenty of reason to question this trios' motives.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":1775.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"35862","byteOffset":27914288,"byteLength":436}},{"id":"DFr_04C4E5C7","articyId":"72057645577538586","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Agent Teleshko","text":"A fellow vendor called Daniel Danetti, a graffiti \"artist\" called Zaffer, and a faulty android who calls himself \"Dotson\".","speakerId":"Ntt_2B1C9A1E","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"A fellow vendor called Daniel Danetti, a graffiti \"artist\" called Zaffer, and a faulty android who calls himself \"Dotson\".","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2375.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"42836","byteOffset":30535680,"byteLength":504}},{"id":"DFr_E79938C6","articyId":"72057645577538614","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Agent Teleshko","text":"Please gather info on them. You are now a source. Learn what you can, then report to me.","speakerId":"Ntt_2B1C9A1E","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Please gather info on them. You are now a source. Learn what you can, then report to me.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2975.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"30864","byteOffset":19557752,"byteLength":468}},{"id":"DFr_91A009E6","articyId":"72057645577538659","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Agent Teleshko","text":"Good. I'll return soon. Remember, gain their trust. Act like you're one of them. But the fact that you're hearing me out... it means you're not like them. You're like me.","speakerId":"Ntt_2B1C9A1E","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Good. I'll return soon. Remember, gain their trust. Act like you're one of them. But the fact that you're hearing me out... it means you're not like them. You're like me.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3875.0,"y":-250.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"43154","byteOffset":30654424,"byteLength":480}},{"id":"DFr_43772520","articyId":"72057645577538664","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Agent Teleshko","text":"Well, further down the line, maybe things get easier for your business. Quick permits. Invasive advertising opportunities. Mandatory custom. There's a lot of ways CorpSec can make your business thrive.","speakerId":"Ntt_2B1C9A1E","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Well, further down the line, maybe things get easier for your business. Quick permits. Invasive advertising opportunities. Mandatory custom. There's a lot of ways CorpSec can make your business thrive.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3875.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"22799","byteOffset":16510352,"byteLength":512}},{"id":"DFr_2269FC78","articyId":"72057645577538669","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Agent Teleshko","text":"You should take some time to think about your decision. Next time we speak, you'll have some information from me. I know you're smarter than you look.","speakerId":"Ntt_2B1C9A1E","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You should take some time to think about your decision. Next time we speak, you'll have some information from me. I know you're smarter than you look.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3875.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"48277","byteOffset":32600448,"byteLength":460}},{"id":"DFr_87FBEEC4","articyId":"72057645577538518","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Uh, hi.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Uh, hi.","TextSheVersion":"Uh, hi.","TextTheyVersion":"Uh, hi."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":300.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"37393","byteOffset":28484736,"byteLength":288}},{"id":"DFr_427F4F60","articyId":"72057645577538530","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Certainly, agent.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Certainly, agent.","TextSheVersion":"Certainly, agent.","TextTheyVersion":"Certainly, agent."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":900.0,"y":-225.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"41448","byteOffset":30008136,"byteLength":300}},{"id":"DFr_067A96F8","articyId":"72057645577538539","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Whatever.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Whatever.","TextSheVersion":"Whatever.","TextTheyVersion":"Wha